{"municipality_code":"11408","pref":"埼玉県","city":"寄居町","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"寄居町には、藤田村、末野村、桜沢村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には寺社や信仰の場、城跡や陣屋跡、産業施設にまつわる場所が点在し、「花園城跡」、「鉢形城跡」、「伊波比神社」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では藤田村、末野村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 ゆかりの人物では松崎半三郎や大島敏に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「玉淀（県名勝）」や「風布川・日本水（湧水・名水百選）」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":7,"rank":1414,"percentile":24.5,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":9,"rank":931,"percentile":48.6,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":21,"rank":1163,"percentile":37.1,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":4,"rank":1499,"percentile":15.1,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":9,"rank":517,"percentile":70.1,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":3,"rank":1069,"percentile":34.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":26,"rank":672,"percentile":63.7,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["松崎半三郎","大島敏","鳥